 - getTransformedLeadObject\\(Object leadObject\\)#{5}":[205,206],"#LeadAPIHelperOOB- Scoped#LeadAPIHelperOOB - getTransformedLeadObject\\(Object leadObject\\)#{6}":[207,232]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Using Lead Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/order-management/lead-management-using.md","line":30},{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":32}],"metadata":{"title":"LeadAPIHelperOOB - Scoped","description":"The LeadAPIHelperOOB script include provides helper methods called by the lead REST API to perform various functions, such as converting a set of lead records from a GlideRecord object into a JSON array or JSON object and transforming fields within a lead object.Converts a GlideRecord object into a JSON object. This method iterates over the fields of the GlideRecord, checks their types, and appropriately formats their values into a JSON-compatible structure.Converts a set of lead records from a GlideRecord object to a JSON array. You must specify the lead record fields that you want included in the JSON array.Transforms the specified lead object.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/LeadAPIHelperOOBAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":3,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[102,114],[182,194],[217,230]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/LeadAPIHelperOOBAPI.md"},
